  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have better control over your delayed powers.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Delay Power.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add your mythic tier to the number of rounds you can delay a power. In addition, you may activate a delayed power as a swift or immediate action instead of as a standard action. Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to manifest a power as a delayed power (gaining only the normal benefits of a delayed power, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without increasing the number of power points spent or expending psionic focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You can delay a power for up to 5 rounds. Activating a delayed power is a standard action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
